        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Split a Channel\n\nPulls one colour channel out of an image as its own greyscale picture. Use it to find which channel holds an artefact or to build a mask. It runs locally with no model, key, or cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"Image\" takes your picture. \"Split\" extracts the red channel, and \"Result\" returns it.\n\n**Try this:** Change the channel on \"Split\" from R to B, since compression noise often shows most clearly in the blue channel."
        },
